{% set ps = practice.online_services.prescriptions %}
{% set oc = practice.online_services.online_consultation %}

<h2>Order a repeat prescription</h2>
<p>You can order repeat prescriptions:</p>
<ul>
  {% if practice.online_services.nhs_app %}<li>in the <a href="{{ practice.nhs_app_link.url }}">{{ practice.nhs_app_link.name }}</a></li>{% endif %}
  <li>using our <a href="{{ oc.url }}">online form</a></li>
  <li>by asking your pharmacy to order it for you, if they offer this</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not take prescription requests over the phone, unless you cannot order any other way.</p>

{% if ps and ps.turnaround %}
<h2>How long it takes</h2>
<p>{{ ps.turnaround }}</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Choosing a pharmacy</h2>
<p>Your prescription will be sent electronically to the pharmacy you choose (called your nominated pharmacy). You can change it in the {{ practice.nhs_app_link.name }} or by asking any pharmacy.</p>

<h2>If you run out of medicine</h2>
<p>If you need medicine urgently and we are closed, a pharmacy may be able to give you an emergency supply. You can also <a href="{{ practice.urgent.nhs111_url }}">get help from {{ practice.urgent.nhs111_name }}</a>.</p>
